---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<Layout 
  title="Privacy Policy | FreeInjuryCalc"
  description="Read the privacy policies of FreeInjuryCalc.com. Discover how we manage log files, cookies, and Google AdSense advertisement protocols."
>
  <Header />

  <main class="flex-grow bg-canvas transition-colors duration-200 py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 font-sans">
      
      <!-- Page Header -->
      <div class="border-b border-hairline pb-8 mb-12">
        <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-link font-mono bg-link-bg-soft/30 dark:bg-link-bg-soft/10 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">
          Data Transparency
        </span>
        <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-ink mt-4 mb-4">
          Privacy Policy
        </h1>
        <p class="text-sm md:text-base text-body leading-relaxed">
          Last updated: June 10, 2026. Your privacy is paramount. Learn how we handle cookies, advertising partners, and anonymous analytical data.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Policy Content -->
      <div class="space-y-8 text-xs md:text-sm text-body leading-relaxed">
        
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-lg md:text-xl font-bold text-ink">1. Information We Collect</h2>
          <p>
            FreeInjuryCalc.com does not require user registration or any form of sign-up. We do not collect personally identifiable information (PII) such as names, phone numbers, home addresses, or social security numbers. Any inputs entered into our calculator engines (e.g., medical expense amounts, hourly wage calculations) are processed strictly in-browser or on-the-fly and are never permanently recorded or associated with your identity on our databases.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-lg md:text-xl font-bold text-ink">2. Log Files</h2>
          <p>
            Like most websites, FreeInjuryCalc.com utilizes standard log files. The information inside these logs includes internet protocol (IP) addresses, browser type, Internet Service Provider (ISP), date/time stamps, referring/exit pages, and the number of clicks. This data is collected purely to analyze trends, administer the site, track user movement, and gather general demographic indicators. This information is not linked to any personally identifiable details.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-lg md:text-xl font-bold text-ink">3. Cookies and Web Beacons</h2>
          <p>
            We use cookies to store information about visitor preferences, record user-specific information on which pages the user accesses, and customize web page content based on browser type or other information sent by the browser.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-4 p-6 border border-hairline bg-canvas-soft-2 rounded-lg">
          <h3 class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-ink font-mono mb-2">Google DoubleClick DART Cookie</h3>
          <p class="text-[11px] leading-relaxed">
            Google, as a third-party vendor, uses cookies to serve ads on FreeInjuryCalc.com. Google's use of the DART cookie enables it to serve ads to our site's visitors based on their visit to FreeInjuryCalc.com and other sites on the Internet. Users may opt out of the use of the DART cookie by visiting the Google Ad and Content Network privacy policy.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-lg md:text-xl font-bold text-ink">4. Our Advertising Partners</h2>
          <p>
            Some of our advertising partners may use cookies and web beacons on our site. Our advertising partners include:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 font-mono text-xs text-ink">
            <li>Google AdSense</li>
          </ul>
          <p>
            These third-party ad servers or ad networks use technology to serve the advertisements and links that appear directly on FreeInjuryCalc.com. They automatically receive your IP address when this occurs. Other technologies (such as cookies, JavaScript, or Web Beacons) may also be used by the third-party ad networks to measure the effectiveness of their advertisements and/or to personalize the advertising content that you see.
          </p>
          <p>
            FreeInjuryCalc.com has no access to or control over these cookies that are used by third-party advertisers.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-lg md:text-xl font-bold text-ink">5. Third Party Privacy Policies</h2>
          <p>
            You should consult the respective privacy policies of these third-party ad servers for more detailed information on their practices as well as for instructions about how to opt-out of certain practices. FreeInjuryCalc.com's privacy policy does not apply to, and we cannot control the activities of, such other advertisers or web sites.
          </p>
          <p>
            If you wish to disable cookies, you may do so through your individual browser options. Detailed information about cookie management with specific web browsers can be found at the browsers' respective websites.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-lg md:text-xl font-bold text-ink">6. Consent</h2>
          <p>
            By using our website, you hereby consent to our privacy policy and agree to its terms.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
